<title>MALAYSIA: Tongkah year net falls 70.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Tongkah year net falls 70.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   3.43   vs	  11.71</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  2.16   vs	  15.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		   205.27   vs	 291.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    23.66   vs	  26.81</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  7.56   vs   less  7.55</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	   2.05</p>
<p>    Dividend			-     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Tongkah Holdings Bhd has three core divisions in financial services, manufacturing and medical services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
